' dji-auto-upload watcher launcher.
'
' The Scheduled Task runs THIS, not PowerShell directly. "powershell.exe
' -WindowStyle Hidden" still allocates a console window before it parses that
' flag, so a console appeared and stayed - and a user who closed it killed the
' watcher, which is exactly what happened in the field.
'
' WScript.Shell.Run with intWindowStyle 0 creates no window at all. This script
' spawns the watcher and exits immediately; the watcher itself holds a
' single-instance mutex, so the task's 5-minute repetition can safely re-run
' this without stacking up watchers.
'
' NOTE: this file must be written WITHOUT a BOM and must stay pure ASCII.
' VBScript cannot parse a UTF-8 BOM - wscript fails with "Invalid character" on
' line 1, and "//B" suppresses the dialog, so it fails completely silently.

Dim shell
Set shell = CreateObject("Wscript.Shell")
shell.Run "powershell.exe -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File ""{{ watcher_path }}""", 0, False
